        <object id="scope" label="JournalEntry is the header; GLEntry holds posted detail. The model does not invent a journal-line table, a close checklist, or a period-lock system.&#10;Independent reconciliation / segregation-of-duties review is a proposed control. Accrued-service settlement has its own supplier-invoice model." bpmnType="heading">
